AB  - In this article, Desiree Cantor explains the concepts of Epics and User Stories from a Business Analyst's perspective. She discusses how these tools help structure and organize work in Agile environments. The article explores how to create effective user stories, their role in capturing requirements, and the importance of clear communication with stakeholders.
